BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:163938@iso-ne.com
DTSTAMP:20260630T094322Z
DTSTART:20260601T210200Z
SUMMARY:Interim Buyer-Side Offer Floor Price Submission Process Beginning June 1\, 2026
DESCRIPTION:Starting June 1\, 2026\, participants may submit the buyer-side offer floor price for capacity resources to ISO New England. During the Capacity Auction Reforms – Prompt (CAR-PD) phase of the overall CAR project\, participants must submit Buyer-Side Offer Floor Price Workbooks via Ask ISO. The use of Ask ISO for these submissions will remain in place while a new application for capacity resource management in support of the CAR is developed.\n\nRefer to the Interim Buyer-Side Offer Floor Price Submission Process Beginning June 1\, 2026\, knowledge article for more information and related materials. If you have questions regarding this message\, please contact the Participant Support and Solutions Team by submitting a case via Ask ISO\, emailing AskISO@iso-ne.com\, or by phone at (413) 540-4220.\nhttps://www.iso-ne.com/event-details?eventId=163938
URL:https://www.iso-ne.com/event-details?eventId=163938
END:VEVENT
