BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:163970@iso-ne.com
DTSTAMP:20260630T094322Z
DTSTART:20260602T171600Z
SUMMARY:FTR Reassignments of PNode 591\, 10037\, 4552\, 13675 effective June 4th\, 2026
DESCRIPTION:As a result of the retirement of UN.PRID_CRN34.5SWBK (591)\, LD.POWERSVL115 (10037)\, LD. BOKUM 27.6 (4552) and UN.BRIGHTON13.8MAT2 (13675)\, active FTRs awarded at the PNodes will be reassigned.\n\nAdditional information can be found on the Financial Transmission Rights webpage.\nhttps://www.iso-ne.com/event-details?eventId=163970
