DESCRIPTION:This webinar covers ISO New England settlements and billing.\n\nTopics include:\n\n\n	Capacity Scarcity Conditions and Pay-for-Performance\n	CLO Bilateral Information Review\n	ISO Load Definitions\n	Ask ISO: Meter Readers\n	2026 Settlement Forum Dates\n\n\nRegister Now!\nContact: Participant Training Services (MkTraining@iso-ne.com)\nhttps://www.iso-ne.com/event-details?eventId=161479
