BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:164112@iso-ne.com
DTSTAMP:20260630T094323Z
DTSTART:20260615T124500Z
SUMMARY:New Capacity Qualification Package Submission Window for the 2026 Interim Reconfiguration Auction Qualification Process is Open and Closes on June 23\, 2026
DESCRIPTION:The New Capacity Qualification Package (NCQP) submittal window for the 2026 interim reconfiguration auction qualification process is open and will close on June 23\, 2026 at 23:59. NCQPs must be submitted to ISO New England through the Forward Capacity Tracking System.\n\nMaterials detailing the NCQP requirements and submission process for the 2026 interim reconfiguration auction qualification process can be found on the ISO-NE Forward Capacity Market Participation Guide webpage: https://www.iso-ne.com/markets-operations/markets/forward-capacity-market/fcm-participation-guide/interim-reconfiguration-auction-qualification.\n\nContact Participant Support at (413) 540-4220 or askiso@iso-ne.com or via an Ask ISO Case for any questions.\nhttps://www.iso-ne.com/event-details?eventId=164112
URL:https://www.iso-ne.com/event-details?eventId=164112
END:VEVENT
