DESCRIPTION:In accordance with Market Rule 1 section III.13.4.2\, the amount of capacity that each Resource may bid or offer into the Forward Capacity Market August 2026 Reconfiguration Auction is available for viewing in the Forward Capacity Market Reconfiguration Auction UI under the terms Max Demand Bid MW and Max Supply Offer MW.\nhttps://www.iso-ne.com/event-details?eventId=164158
URL:https://www.iso-ne.com/event-details?eventId=164158
END:VEVENT
