DTSTAMP:20260630T094323Z
DTSTART:20260622T134400Z
SUMMARY:August 2026 FTR Bidding Window to Open
DESCRIPTION:The bidding window for the August 2026 FTR Prompt Auction and Balance of Planning Period will open on July 14\, 2026 (00:00) and will close on July 16\, 2026 (11:00 AM). The August 2026 FTR Auction results will be posted by July 31\, 2026. Registered FTR customers will find assumptions and related information for this auction posted on the FTR Assumptions page available by link from eFTR. For additional information\, please see the eFTR User Guide and ISO New England Manual for Financial Transmission Rights\, M-06\nhttps://www.iso-ne.com/event-details?eventId=164185
URL:https://www.iso-ne.com/event-details?eventId=164185
