UID:164201@iso-ne.com
DTSTAMP:20260630T094323Z
DTSTART:20260623T120000Z
SUMMARY:ISO New England will be taking a maintenance outage of Internal Market Monitoring Asset Characteristics (IMMAC) on Tuesday\, June 23\, 2026\, from 08:00 to 18:00 Hrs
DESCRIPTION:ISO New England will be taking a maintenance outage of Internal Market Monitoring Asset Characteristics (IMMAC) on Tuesday\, June 23\, 2026\, from 08:00 to 18:00 Hrs. During the outage\, users will not be able to connect to IMMAC.\nhttps://www.iso-ne.com/event-details?eventId=164201
URL:https://www.iso-ne.com/event-details?eventId=164201
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:164207@iso-ne.com
DTSTAMP:20260630T094323Z
DTSTART:20260623T125400Z
SUMMARY:New Capacity Qualification Package Submission Window for the 2026 Interim Reconfiguration Auction Qualification Process is Open and Closes on June 23\, 2026
DESCRIPTION:The New Capacity Qualification Package (NCQP) submittal window for the 2026 interim reconfiguration auction qualification process is open and will close on June 23\, 2026 at 23:59. NCQPs must be submitted to ISO New England through the Forward Capacity Tracking System.\n\nMaterials detailing the NCQP requirements and submission process for the 2026 interim reconfiguration auction qualification process can be found on the ISO-NE Forward Capacity Market Participation Guide webpage: https://www.iso-ne.com/markets-operations/markets/forward-capacity-market/fcm-participation-guide/interim-reconfiguration-auction-qualification.\n\nContact Participant Support at (413) 540-4220 or askiso@iso-ne.com or via an Ask ISO Case for any questions.\nhttps://www.iso-ne.com/event-details?eventId=164207
URL:https://www.iso-ne.com/event-details?eventId=164207
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:164209@iso-ne.com
DTSTAMP:20260630T094323Z
DTSTART:20260623T130000Z
SUMMARY:ISO New England will perform a series of software upgrades to the Limit Exchange Portal (LEP) Sandbox application from 9:00 on Tuesday\, 06/23/2026\, through 17:00 on Thursday\, 06/25/2026. 
DESCRIPTION:ISO New England will perform a series of software upgrades to the Limit Exchange Portal (LEP) Sandbox application from 9:00 on Tuesday\, 06/23/2026\, through 17:00 on Thursday\, 06/25/2026.\n\nThe LEP Sandbox application will be intermittently unavailable during this timeframe.\nhttps://www.iso-ne.com/event-details?eventId=164209
URL:https://www.iso-ne.com/event-details?eventId=164209
END:VEVENT
