SUMMARY:Forward Capacity Market Capacity Supply Obligation Bilateral Period and Monthly Reconfiguration Auction for September 2026 to Open
DESCRIPTION:In accordance with Market Rule 1\, Sections III.13.4 and III.13.5\, the submission period for submitting Capacity Supply Obligation Bilateral Contracts to the Forward Capacity Market CSO Bilateral Period for September 2026 will open on July 10\, 2026 (00:00) and will close on July 13\, 2026 (11:00). The submission period for submitting bids and offers to the Forward Capacity Market Monthly Reconfiguration Auction for September 2026 will open on July 21\, 2026 (00:00) and will close on July 22\, 2026 (11:00).\nhttps://www.iso-ne.com/event-details?eventId=164235
