BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:163675@iso-ne.com
DTSTAMP:20260630T094323Z
DTSTART:20260630T140000Z
DTEND:20260630T160000Z
SUMMARY:NX Application Transition to FERC Order 881 
LOCATION:Webinar
DESCRIPTION:This session will cover changes to the NX-9 form fields\, the removal of traditional seasonal ratings\, and the addition of Limit Exchange Portal (LEP) information resulting from FERC Order 881.  Instructions and the timeline for migrating all existing NX-9 data to the post-881 format will also be provided.  \n\n\n\nRegister Now.\nContact: Market Training (MkTraining@iso-ne.com)\nhttps://www.iso-ne.com/event-details?eventId=163675
URL:https://www.iso-ne.com/event-details?eventId=163675
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:164286@iso-ne.com
DTSTAMP:20260630T094323Z
DTSTART:20260630T150000Z
SUMMARY:ISO New England will be performing a maintenance outage of the NX Production and Sandbox environments\, as well as the LEP Sandbox environment\, on Tuesday\, June 30\, 2026\, from 11:00 to 13:00 Hrs
DESCRIPTION:ISO New England will be performing a maintenance outage of the NX Production and Sandbox environments\, as well as the LEP Sandbox environment\, on Tuesday\, June 30\, 2026\, from 11:00 to 13:00 Hrs. The NX Production\, NX Sandbox\, and LEP Sandbox environments will be unavailable intermittently during the outage.\nhttps://www.iso-ne.com/event-details?eventId=164286
URL:https://www.iso-ne.com/event-details?eventId=164286
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:164284@iso-ne.com
DTSTAMP:20260630T094323Z
DTSTART:20260630T183000Z
SUMMARY:On Tuesday\, June 30\, 2026\, ISO New England will be performing routine maintenance on its Market servers between 14:30 and 16:30 hours.
DESCRIPTION:On Tuesday\, June 30\, 2026\, ISO New England will be performing routine maintenance on its Market servers between 14:30 and 16:30 hours. \n\nDuring this outage window:\n\n\n\n- There might be missing 5-minute locational marginal prices (LMPs) and Regulation Clearing Prices (RCPs).\n\n- The generating units might receive stale DDPs/DNEs (to the RTUs).\nhttps://www.iso-ne.com/event-details?eventId=164284
URL:https://www.iso-ne.com/event-details?eventId=164284
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
